{"1210540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TCM RACING 2", "steam_appid": 1210540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<i><strong>TCM RACING 2</strong></i> Is a sandbox racing game where you can do anything!<br><br>You are a TCM Group member, who witnessed the attacker's revenge in the event of complete destruction. The Portal that the group crafted is for safety and you must reach it before they deliver more damage against you<br><br>Once you're in, you're full on freedom, ready to do anything you'd like. <i>(but there is a twist.)</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1210540/extras/c8b6f03552d4cd07e0d2313ec2160eef.poster.avif?t=1772388955\" width=368 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1210540/extras/c8b6f03552d4cd07e0d2313ec2160eef.webm?t=1772388955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1210540/extras/c8b6f03552d4cd07e0d2313ec2160eef.mp4?t=1772388955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Multiplayer<br>- Mode Designer (Create your own game-modes)<br>- 4 weapons<br>- Missions<br>- Many game-modes to choose from", "about_the_game": "<i><strong>TCM RACING 2</strong></i> Is a sandbox racing game where you can do anything!<br><br>You are a TCM Group member, who witnessed the attacker's revenge in the event of complete destruction. The Portal that the group crafted is for safety and you must reach it before they deliver more damage against you<br><br>Once you're in, you're full on freedom, ready to do anything you'd like. <i>(but there is a twist.)</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1210540/extras/c8b6f03552d4cd07e0d2313ec